01:02:26,780 --> 01:02:28,780
And these CMOs

1390
01:02:28,780 --> 01:02:30,780
were

1391
01:02:30,780 --> 01:02:32,780
sold to investors all over the world.

1392
01:02:34,780 --> 01:02:36,780
Another kind of security which

1393
01:02:36,780 --> 01:02:38,780
