01:02:46,780 --> 01:02:48,780
And they typically hold mortgage securities

1399
01:02:48,780 --> 01:02:50,780
as their assets.

1400
01:02:50,780 --> 01:02:52,780
Many of them held subprime

1401
01:02:52,780 --> 01:02:54,780
mortgages in recent years.

1402
01:02:54,780 --> 01:02:56,780
Mortgages that were

1403
01:02:56,780 --> 01:02:58,780
issued against subprime borrowers.

1404
01:02:58,780 --> 01:03:00,780
And

1405
01:03:00,780 --> 01:03:02,780
a lot

1406
01:03:02,780 --> 01:03:04,780
of these securities that were rated

1407
01:03:04,780 --> 01:03:06,780
