1412
01:03:14,780 --> 01:03:16,780
all over the world. The United

1413
01:03:16,780 --> 01:03:18,780
States is a leader in

1414
01:03:18,780 --> 01:03:20,780
mortgage finance. And

1415
01:03:20,780 --> 01:03:22,780
it was issuing

1416
01:03:22,780 --> 01:03:24,780
companies in the United States

1417
01:03:24,780 --> 01:03:26,780
were issuing, not just Fannie

1418
01:03:26,780 --> 01:03:28,780
and Freddie, but lots of companies were

1419
01:03:28,780 --> 01:03:30,780
issuing mortgage securities

1420
01:03:30,780 --> 01:03:32,780
that had triple A ratings.

1421
01:03:32,780 --> 01:03:34,780
Which meant that Moody's

1422
01:03:34,780 --> 01:03:36,780
and Standard and Poor's and the other

1423
01:03:36,780 --> 01:03:38,780
rating agencies were telling you

1424
01:03:38,780 --> 01:03:40,780
basically there was no risk to them.

1425
01:03:40,780 --> 01:03:42,780
And so people in Europe,

1426
01:03:42,780 --> 01:03:44,780
in Asia were investing in these.

1427
01:03:44,780 --> 01:03:46,780
And they thought they were perfectly

1428
01:03:46,780 --> 01:03:48,780
safe. And then they went

1429
01:03:48,780 --> 01:03:50,780
under.

1430
01:03:50,780 --> 01:03:52,780
And part

1431
01:03:52,780 --> 01:03:54,780
of it was bad faith dealings

1432
01:03:54,780 --> 01:03:56,780
by some of the issuers. Some of the

1433
01:03:56,780 --> 01:03:58,780
issuers

1434
01:03:58,780 --> 01:04:00,780
themselves doubted that these mortgages

1435
01:04:00,780 --> 01:04:02,780
were so safe. But

1436
01:04:02,780 --> 01:04:04,780
what do I care?

1437
01:04:04,780 --> 01:04:06,780
This is what happened. Somebody

1438
01:04:06,780 --> 01:04:08,780
originated, it's gotten to be

1439
01:04:08,780 --> 01:04:10,780
a complicated set of steps.

1440
01:04:10,780 --> 01:04:12,780
Somebody

1441
01:04:12,780 --> 01:04:14,780
originates the mortgage. That

1442
01:04:14,780 --> 01:04:16,780
means I talk to the homeowner, I

1443
01:04:16,780 --> 01:04:18,780
have the homeowner fill out the papers.

1444
01:04:18,780 --> 01:04:20,780
Then after they've originated the

1445
01:04:20,780 --> 01:04:22,780
mortgage, they sell it to

1446
01:04:22,780 --> 01:04:24,780
an investor,

1447
01:04:24,780 --> 01:04:26,780
like Fannie or Freddie or some private

1448
01:04:26,780 --> 01:04:28,780
mortgage securitizer.

1449
01:04:28,780 --> 01:04:30,780
And the private

1450
01:04:30,780 --> 01:04:32,780
mortgage securitizer finds

1451
01:04:32,780 --> 01:04:34,780
a mortgage servicer, it may be

1452
01:04:34,780 --> 01:04:36,780
the originator, who will then

1453
01:04:36,780 --> 01:04:38,780
