1455
01:04:40,780 --> 01:04:41,780
to call you on the

1456
01:04:41,780 --> 01:04:42,780
phone if you missed your payment,

1457
01:04:42,780 --> 01:04:44,780
for example. Or if you have

1458
01:04:44,780 --> 01:04:46,780
questions about the mortgage, there should be someone

1459
01:04:46,780 --> 01:04:48,780
you call. So the mortgage servicer

1460
01:04:48,780 --> 01:04:50,780
does that. So that's a separate entity.

1461
01:04:50,780 --> 01:04:52,780
And then we have the CMO

1462
01:04:52,780 --> 01:04:54,780
organizer,

1463
01:04:54,780 --> 01:04:56,780
the originator. And then we have the CDO

1464
01:04:56,780 --> 01:04:58,780
originator. It's gotten to be a very

1465
01:04:58,780 --> 01:05:00,780
complicated financial system.

1466
01:05:00,780 --> 01:05:02,780
And then the whole thing collapsed.

1467
01:05:02,780 --> 01:05:04,780
So

1468
01:05:04,780 --> 01:05:06,780
there's been a lot of reform

1469
01:05:06,780 --> 01:05:08,780
to try to see what can we

1470
01:05:08,780 --> 01:05:10,780
