01:05:14,780 --> 01:05:16,780
Let's not have mortgage securitizers.

1474
01:05:16,780 --> 01:05:18,780
But that's not

1475
01:05:18,780 --> 01:05:20,780
the steps that have been taken.

1476
01:05:20,780 --> 01:05:22,780
I think that

1477
01:05:22,780 --> 01:05:24,780
we are making progress.

1478
01:05:24,780 --> 01:05:26,780
And I want to just conclude with

1479
01:05:26,780 --> 01:05:28,780
just a little reference to

1480
01:05:28,780 --> 01:05:30,780
one important change that

1481
01:05:30,780 --> 01:05:32,780
was made in both

1482
01:05:32,780 --> 01:05:34,780
Europe and the United States.

1483
01:05:34,780 --> 01:05:36,780
So the

1484
01:05:36,780 --> 01:05:38,780
European Parliament

1485
01:05:38,780 --> 01:05:40,780
passed a

1486
01:05:40,780 --> 01:05:42,780
new directive

1487
01:05:42,780 --> 01:05:44,780
that requires

1488
01:05:44,780 --> 01:05:46,780
or incentivizes

1489
01:05:46,780 --> 01:05:48,780
mortgage

1490
01:05:48,780 --> 01:05:50,780
originators to keep

1491
01:05:50,780 --> 01:05:52,780
5% of the

1492
01:05:52,780 --> 01:05:54,780
mortgage balance in their own portfolio.

1493
01:05:54,780 --> 01:05:56,780
So that means if you originate

1494
01:05:56,780 --> 01:05:58,780
a portfolio, you can sell off

1495
01:05:58,780 --> 01:06:00,780
if you originate mortgages,

1496
01:06:00,780 --> 01:06:02,780
you can sell off 95%

1497
01:06:02,780 --> 01:06:04,780
of the mortgages to investors.

1498
01:06:04,780 --> 01:06:06,780
But you have to keep 5%.

1499
01:06:06,780 --> 01:06:08,780
So this 5% limit

1500
01:06:08,780 --> 01:06:10,780
was then later

1501
01:06:10,780 --> 01:06:12,780
