1502
01:06:12,780 --> 01:06:14,780
Act in the United States.

1503
01:06:14,780 --> 01:06:16,780
So we again have the same

1504
01:06:16,780 --> 01:06:18,780
requirement.

1505
01:06:18,780 --> 01:06:20,780
And this is supposed to

1506
01:06:20,780 --> 01:06:22,780
reduce the moral hazard problem

1507
01:06:22,780 --> 01:06:24,780
that created

1508
01:06:24,780 --> 01:06:26,780
the crisis and retain

1509
01:06:26,780 --> 01:06:28,780
the mortgage securitization

1510
01:06:28,780 --> 01:06:30,780
process.

1511
01:06:30,780 --> 01:06:32,780
So the

1512
01:06:32,780 --> 01:06:34,780
idea is this.

1513
01:06:34,780 --> 01:06:36,780
I know I heard people tell me,

1514
01:06:36,780 --> 01:06:38,780
mortgage originators

1515
01:06:38,780 --> 01:06:40,780
