1518
01:06:44,780 --> 01:06:46,780
what do I care?

1519
01:06:46,780 --> 01:06:48,780
I think this family doesn't look,

1520
01:06:48,780 --> 01:06:50,780
they're not going to pay this back.

1521
01:06:52,780 --> 01:06:54,780
But what do I care?

1522
01:06:54,780 --> 01:06:56,780
I'll fill it out, I'll sell the mortgage

1523
01:06:56,780 --> 01:06:58,780
to someone else and I'm out of here.

1524
01:06:58,780 --> 01:07:00,780
In fact, it got bad

1525
01:07:00,780 --> 01:07:02,780
in some cases.

1526
01:07:02,780 --> 01:07:04,780
Some mortgage brokers, a family would come in

1527
01:07:04,780 --> 01:07:06,780
offering to, wanted to buy a house

1528
01:07:06,780 --> 01:07:08,780
and the mortgage broker would say that,

1529
01:07:08,780 --> 01:07:10,780
well, what is your income anyway?

1530
01:07:10,780 --> 01:07:12,780
And

1531
01:07:12,780 --> 01:07:14,780
they would tell him the income and he would say,

1532
01:07:14,780 --> 01:07:16,780
you're trying to buy a $300,000

1533
01:07:16,780 --> 01:07:18,780
house on that income?

1534
01:07:18,780 --> 01:07:20,780
I said, I don't know if I can do this.

1535
01:07:20,780 --> 01:07:22,780
But then he would say,

1536
01:07:22,780 --> 01:07:24,780
wait a minute, think about this again.

1537
01:07:24,780 --> 01:07:26,780
Is that really your income?

1538
01:07:26,780 --> 01:07:28,780
You told me your income is $40,000

1539
01:07:28,780 --> 01:07:30,780
a year. Are you sure?

1540
01:07:30,780 --> 01:07:32,780
Don't you have some other, why don't we say

1541
01:07:32,780 --> 01:07:34,780
$50,000 a year?

1542
01:07:34,780 --> 01:07:36,780
Or I'll say $60,000 a year.

1543
01:07:36,780 --> 01:07:38,780
And the mortgage broker would look at him

1544
01:07:38,780 --> 01:07:40,780
in disbelief and say,

1545
01:07:40,780 --> 01:07:42,780
no, we only have $40,000.

1546
01:07:42,780 --> 01:07:44,780
He said, well, think about it.

1547
01:07:44,780 --> 01:07:46,780
You have other sources, don't you?

1548
01:07:46,780 --> 01:07:48,780
And he said, everybody does this.

1549
01:07:48,780 --> 01:07:50,780
So, okay, we have $60,000.

1550
01:07:50,780 --> 01:07:52,780
He says, fine.

1551
01:07:52,780 --> 01:07:54,780
And he,

1552
01:07:54,780 --> 01:07:56,780
and they thought, well, the mortgage broker

1553
01:07:56,780 --> 01:07:58,780
gave me permission to do this.

1554
01:07:58,780 --> 01:08:00,780
And he doesn't care

1555
01:08:00,780 --> 01:08:02,780
because he's not going to take the loss.

1556
01:08:02,780 --> 01:08:04,780
So, the new law

1557
01:08:04,780 --> 01:08:06,780
is supposed to discourage that kind of thing.

1558
01:08:06,780 --> 01:08:07,780
And it has lots of new

1559
01:08:07,780 --> 01:08:08,780
laws that are trying to tighten up.

1560
01:08:08,780 --> 01:08:10,780
For example, mortgage brokers in the United States

1561
01:08:10,780 --> 01:08:12,780
