1564
01:08:16,779 --> 01:08:18,779
and you could take up a business as

1565
01:08:18,779 --> 01:08:20,779
mortgage broker. You can't anymore.

1566
01:08:20,779 --> 01:08:22,779
So, what's happening all over the world

1567
01:08:22,779 --> 01:08:24,779
is that we've learned from this experience,

1568
01:08:24,779 --> 01:08:26,779
but we're retaining this basic

1569
01:08:26,779 --> 01:08:28,779
system of mortgage

1570
01:08:28,779 --> 01:08:30,779
