1571
01:08:30,779 --> 01:08:32,779
that are professional.

1572
01:08:32,779 --> 01:08:34,779
The basic industry has been retained.

1573
01:08:34,779 --> 01:08:36,779
And we're hoping and thinking

1574
01:08:36,779 --> 01:08:38,779
